{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dreamwalkers is a 2D Visual Novel/Point-and-Click Adventure Game in which you can project yourself into the world of Dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play Morgan, a student in History of the Arts in Paris, who\u2019s life is about to be turned upside down. Along his journey he will meet new friends, whose fate will be into your hands.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 acts of 45mn each. Perfect for lunch break diversions! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly replayable: the story is divided into 2 mutually exclusive branches, each focused on the relationship between Morgan and one of the Dreamwalkers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance: will Morgan fall in love with this Dreamwalker or just be friend? Your decision!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different endings depending on choices you\u2019ll have to own up (and no Mass Effect-style: some endings will depend on choices made earlier in the game)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Dreams: scenes in the world of dreams can be explored in point &amp; click phases to discover more about the universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Universe: inspired by Neil Gaiman and Inception, we created a world where myths and reality intertwine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds and characters drawn by talented artists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original music is a symphony in 5 movements created by a composer and played by an orchestra!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8fdee1398653bcd9c2e1a0b44e62890fac4d8b6e.jpg","localized_name":"Get seen!","name":"Get seen!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1175400/8fdee1398653bcd9c2e1a0b44e62890fac4d8b6e.jpg"},{"icon":"91c4199c4c0d662b82757b12f7986dba810fe67b.jp