_description":"Take control of Morgan's destiny as his world is turned upside down. Explore the world of Dreams, where mythological creatures and Nightmares are real. A story-heavy adventure game with multiple endings, romance options and a symphonic music! Inspired by Neil Gaiman and Inception.","steam_appid":1175400,"support_info":{"email":"contact@nightbloomer.fr","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French","type":"game","website":"http://www.dreamwalkers-game.com"}